# Reliability

- Persist domain events via transactional outbox (`platform/messaging`, `outbox_message`); worker publishes to SQS.
- Support `Idempotency-Key` on mutating payment-like endpoints.
- No sync fan-out of external side effects in the request path when an async boundary exists.
- New queues need a DLQ + alarm path (see agent `reliability-sre`).
- Uploads: S3 presigned PUT/GET only (max 10 MB product rule). Never proxy large multipart through Lambda/API Gateway.
- Schedules: EventBridge in `Asia/Kolkata`; store timestamps in UTC.
- Platform SLO targets live in EPIC-020 (`docs/requirements/EPIC-020-observability-self-healing/EPIC.md`).
